        "id": "s1",
        "passed": true
      }
    ],
    "summary": "EpicsBody carries six stage sections (each epic at the stage of its least-advanced story, epics with no stories after the boxes), built from the shared sectionHead that the board and Issues screens also use; the webview renders them in the shared stage boxes, with 'No stories yet' from the labels table. Refresh is an icon-only button named 'Refresh' with a tooltip. Full plugin suite: 966 tests, 961 pass, 4 skipped, 1 known baseline failure.",
